    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "e167e73b-ddbc-43f0-a3a5-7a55b11a3c5c",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "I Had 3 Characters Left In the Briefing",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COASTALTOWN",
        "PublicId": "103594623106",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/CoastalTown/_scene_octopus.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 82302da5-caea-4d8f-b82b-c43c2e4f1897).Image",
        "Description": "Hello, 47, welcome to Sapienza. Your target is Russian diplomat Sergei Horoshih. Born during the time of the USSR, Sergei has grown to be a powerful figure in Russian politics and has heavy involvement in the European Union and former Soviet countries.\r\rHe began his career as a Russian FSB agent, before devoting his life to journalism. His crimes are various, but most recently, he led a mass casualty event in Azerbaijan after the government imposed a sanction against Russian officials. Following the event, he fled to Italy. After digging more into his plans, we discovered that he intends on meeting with a French delegate shortly after his arrival. Our request is that you eliminate him discreetly, preferably in a manner that can’t be traced back to us.\r\rOn behalf of the ICA, it would indeed be a great service for you to eliminate him, 47. After the completion of this contract, I can assure you that the agency won’t be the only one congratulating you on a job well done. Good luck.",
